  ('q4-01', 'p4-01', 4, 1, 'Where is the announcement most likely taking place?', '[{"key":"A","text":"At a railway station platform"},{"key":"B","text":"In an airport passenger terminal"},{"key":"C","text":"Onboard a cruise ship"},{"key":"D","text":"At a commercial bus depot"}]'::jsonb, 'B', 'El vocabulario como "Flight 482", "Gate B14", "Skyway Airlines" y "boarding passes" sitúa la acción en un aeropuerto.', 'Identificación de lugar / contexto', 'easy', NULL),
