  ('q4-06', 'p4-02', 4, 6, 'What is Mr. Vasquez requested to do before 4 P.M. today?', '[{"key":"A","text":"Process an electronic wire payment"},{"key":"B","text":"Assemble the conference desks himself"},{"key":"C","text":"Notify the superintendent and call back Brenda"},{"key":"D","text":"Pick up the chairs at the distribution center"}]'::jsonb, 'C', 'La instrucción final solicita avisar al conserje/administrador y llamar a Brenda antes de las 4:00 p.m.', 'Peticiones y plazos en mensajes', 'medium', NULL),
