  ('q5-01', NULL, 5, 1, 'Ms. Thornton requested that all department managers submit their quarterly budgets _______ Friday at noon.', '[{"key":"A","text":"by"},{"key":"B","text":"until"},{"key":"C","text":"during"},{"key":"D","text":"through"}]'::jsonb, 'A', '"By" se utiliza para indicar una fecha u hora límite puntual (deadline: antes de o a más tardar a las doce del viernes), a diferencia de "until" que describe una acción continua que se detiene en ese momento.', 'Preposiciones de tiempo y límite (By vs Until)', 'easy', NULL),
  ('q5-02', NULL, 5, 2, 'The newly introduced software program has _______ reduced the time needed to process customer invoices.', '[{"key":"A","text":"signify"},{"key":"B","text":"significant"},{"key":"C","text":"significantly"},{"key":"D","text":"significance"}]'::jsonb, 'C', 'Se requiere un adverbio ("significantly") para modificar el participio pasado del verbo compuesto ("has reduced").', 'Formas de palabras (Adverbios de modo)', 'easy', NULL),
  ('q5-03', NULL, 5, 3, '_______ the economic downturn in the retail sector, Omnicorp reported a ten percent increase in overseas revenues.', '[{"key":"A","text":"Although"},{"key":"B","text":"Despite"},{"key":"C","text":"Even though"},{"key":"D","text":"Whereas"}]'::jsonb, 'B', '"Despite" es una preposición concesiva seguida de una frase nominal ("the economic downturn"). "Although" y "Even though" requieren una cláusula completa con sujeto y verbo conjugado.', 'Conectores concesivos (Despite vs Although)', 'medium', NULL),
  ('q5-04', NULL, 5, 4, 'Employees who wish to enroll in the executive leadership seminar must obtain written _______ from their direct supervisor.', '[{"key":"A","text":"approve"},{"key":"B","text":"approval"},{"key":"C","text":"approvingly"},{"key":"D","text":"approved"}]'::jsonb, 'B', 'El adjetivo "written" califica a un sustantivo ("approval" = aprobación escrita), que actúa como objeto directo de "obtain".', 'Formas de palabras (Sustantivos)', 'easy', NULL),
  ('q5-05', NULL, 5, 5, 'The human resources committee has finalized _______ review of the updated corporate telecommuting policy.', '[{"key":"A","text":"its"},{"key":"B","text":"it’s"},{"key":"C","text":"their"},{"key":"D","text":"theirs"}]'::jsonb, 'A', '"The human resources committee" es un sustantivo colectivo singular neutro en inglés formal de negocios, por lo que el adjetivo posesivo correcto es "its" (sin apóstrofe).', 'Pronombres y posesivos', 'medium', NULL),
  ('q5-06', NULL, 5, 6, 'The keynote speaker’s flight was delayed, but the organizers managed to _______ the conference schedule without major disruption.', '[{"key":"A","text":"accommodate"},{"key":"B","text":"speculate"},{"key":"C","text":"hesitate"},{"key":"D","text":"generate"}]'::jsonb, 'A', '"Accommodate" en contexto empresarial significa adaptar o ajustar para dar cabida a una necesidad o cambio imprevisto.', 'Vocabulario de negocios de alta frecuencia', 'hard', NULL),
  ('q5-07', NULL, 5, 7, 'Had Mr. Albright reviewed the shipping manifesto earlier, the distribution error _______ detected prior to departure.', '[{"key":"A","text":"would have been"},{"key":"B","text":"will be"},{"key":"C","text":"is being"},{"key":"D","text":"has been"}]'::jsonb, 'A', 'Estructura condicional de tercer tipo invertida ("Had + sujeto + participio pasado"). La cláusula principal requiere "would have been + participio".', 'Condicionales avanzados e inversiones', 'hard', NULL),
  ('q5-08', NULL, 5, 8, 'Any defective merchandise returned within thirty days of purchase is _______ for a full monetary refund.', '[{"key":"A","text":"eligible"},{"key":"B","text":"reliant"},{"key":"C","text":"advisable"},{"key":"D","text":"convenient"}]'::jsonb, 'A', 'El adjetivo "eligible" se combina naturalmente con la preposición "for" ("eligible for a refund" = con derecho o calificado para un reembolso).', 'Colocaciones adjetivales y preposiciones', 'easy', NULL),
  ('q5-09', NULL, 5, 9, 'The legal team spent several hours _______ the terms of the merger agreement to ensure total regulatory compliance.', '[{"key":"A","text":"examine"},{"key":"B","text":"examining"},{"key":"C","text":"examined"},{"key":"D","text":"examination"}]'::jsonb, 'B', 'La estructura "spend time + gerundio (V-ing)" exige "examining".', 'Estructuras con gerundios e infinitivos', 'medium', NULL),
  ('q5-10', NULL, 5, 10, 'Because of high seasonal demand, customers are advised to place their orders _______ in advance.', '[{"key":"A","text":"well"},{"key":"B","text":"soon"},{"key":"C","text":"just"},{"key":"D","text":"near"}]'::jsonb, 'A', '"Well in advance" es una frase hecha fija de negocios que significa con bastante antelación.', 'Modismos y frases idiomáticas de negocios', 'medium', NULL),
  ('q5-11', NULL, 5, 11, 'The newly constructed pharmaceutical research facility is located _______ the river and the highway.', '[{"key":"A","text":"between"},{"key":"B","text":"among"},{"key":"C","text":"amidst"},{"key":"D","text":"across"}]'::jsonb, 'A', '"Between" se utiliza para situar algo entre dos puntos o elementos específicos ("the river and the highway").', 'Preposiciones de lugar', 'easy', NULL),
  ('q5-12', NULL, 5, 12, 'Sales representatives who meet their annual quotas will receive a _______ financial bonus.', '[{"key":"A","text":"substantially"},{"key":"B","text":"substance"},{"key":"C","text":"substantial"},{"key":"D","text":"substantiate"}]'::jsonb, 'C', 'Se requiere el adjetivo "substantial" para calificar al sustantivo "financial bonus".', 'Formas de palabras (Adjetivos)', 'easy', NULL),
  ('q5-13', NULL, 5, 13, 'Neither the department supervisor _______ the laboratory technicians were aware of the power outage.', '[{"key":"A","text":"or"},{"key":"B","text":"nor"},{"key":"C","text":"and"},{"key":"D","text":"either"}]'::jsonb, 'B', 'La conjunción correlativa de "Neither" es obligatoriamente "nor".', 'Conjunciones correlativas', 'easy', NULL),
  ('q5-14', NULL, 5, 14, 'All confidential customer records must be stored _______ on the secured server.', '[{"key":"A","text":"safely"},{"key":"B","text":"safe"},{"key":"C","text":"safety"},{"key":"D","text":"safeness"}]'::jsonb, 'A', 'El adverbio "safely" califica la acción de almacenar ("stored safely").', 'Formas de palabras (Adverbios)', 'easy', NULL),
  ('q5-15', NULL, 5, 15, 'The board of directors commended Ms. Chen for her _______ dedication to community outreach programs.', '[{"key":"A","text":"exception"},{"key":"B","text":"exceptional"},{"key":"C","text":"exceptionally"},{"key":"D","text":"except"}]'::jsonb, 'B', '"Exceptional" es el adjetivo que modifica al sustantivo "dedication".', 'Formas de palabras (Adjetivos)', 'easy', NULL)
