  ('q6-01', 'p6-01', 6, 1, 'Select the best option for blank [1]:', '[{"key":"A","text":"addition"},{"key":"B","text":"additional"},{"key":"C","text":"additionally"},{"key":"D","text":"add"}]'::jsonb, 'B', 'El adjetivo "additional" (espacio de trabajo adicional) califica adecuadamente al sustantivo "workspace".', 'Formas de palabras (Adjetivos modificadores)', 'easy', NULL),
  ('q6-02', 'p6-01', 6, 2, 'Select the best option for blank [2]:', '[{"key":"A","text":"are placed"},{"key":"B","text":"placing"},{"key":"C","text":"had placed"},{"key":"D","text":"places"}]'::jsonb, 'A', 'Estructura pasiva en presente ("are placed"): los cables y accesorios son colocados dentro de las cajas designadas.', 'Voz pasiva', 'medium', NULL),
  ('q6-03', 'p6-01', 6, 3, 'Select the best option for blank [3]:', '[{"key":"A","text":"Please leave all desktop monitors turned on."},{"key":"B","text":"Staff members are invited to bring their families."},{"key":"C","text":"Boxes that are not properly labeled will not be transported."},{"key":"D","text":"The cafeteria menu will change next month."}]'::jsonb, 'C', 'La oración C se integra lógicamente con la advertencia anterior sobre empacar en cajas etiquetadas para la mudanza.', 'Inserción de oración coherente', 'hard', NULL),
  ('q6-04', 'p6-01', 6, 4, 'Select the best option for blank [4]:', '[{"key":"A","text":"directly"},{"key":"B","text":"direct"},{"key":"C","text":"direction"},{"key":"D","text":"directed"}]'::jsonb, 'A', 'El adverbio "directly" (contactar a nuestro departamento directamente) modifica al verbo transitivo "contact".', 'Adverbios de modo', 'easy', NULL),
  ('q6-05', 'p6-02', 6, 5, 'Select the best option for blank [1]:', '[{"key":"A","text":"expire"},{"key":"B","text":"expiration"},{"key":"C","text":"expired"},{"key":"D","text":"expiring"}]'::jsonb, 'A', 'La expresión "is due to" va seguida del verbo en forma base o infinitivo ("is due to expire" = está por vencer).', 'Infinitivos tras locuciones verbales', 'easy', NULL),
  ('q6-06', 'p6-02', 6, 6, 'Select the best option for blank [2]:', '[{"key":"A","text":"No action is required on your part if your account info is current."},{"key":"B","text":"Our phone lines are disconnected indefinitely."},{"key":"C","text":"We have discontinued our subscription services."},{"key":"D","text":"Prices will triple starting tomorrow morning."}]'::jsonb, 'A', 'La opción A conecta coherentemente con la renovación automática mencionada en la oración precedente.', 'Inserción de oración contextual', 'medium', NULL),
  ('q6-07', 'p6-02', 6, 7, 'Select the best option for blank [3]:', '[{"key":"A","text":"committed"},{"key":"B","text":"commitment"},{"key":"C","text":"committing"},{"key":"D","text":"commits"}]'::jsonb, 'A', '"Remain committed to" es una colocación fija en correspondencia formal corporativa ("permanecemos comprometidos con").', 'Colocaciones participiales y adjetivales', 'medium', NULL),
  ('q6-08', 'p6-02', 6, 8, 'Select the best option for blank [4]:', '[{"key":"A","text":"As a token of appreciation, we have credited your account with 50 GB of bonus storage."},{"key":"B","text":"We regret to inform you that your data has been deleted."},{"key":"C","text":"Our offices are closed on weekends."},{"key":"D","text":"Please return the hardware by postal mail."}]'::jsonb, 'A', 'La oración A ofrece una bonificación de agradecimiento que concuerda perfectamente con el tono comercial de fidelización.', 'Inserción de oración de cortesía comercial', 'medium', NULL),
  ('q6-09', 'p6-03', 6, 9, 'Select the best option for blank [1]:', '[{"key":"A","text":"comprehensive"},{"key":"B","text":"comprehensively"},{"key":"C","text":"comprehend"},{"key":"D","text":"comprehension"}]'::jsonb, 'A', 'El adjetivo "comprehensive" (exhaustivo, integral) califica adecuadamente al sustantivo plural "guidelines".', 'Formas de palabras (Adjetivos)', 'medium', NULL),
  ('q6-10', 'p6-03', 6, 10, 'Select the best option for blank [2]:', '[{"key":"A","text":"thoroughly"},{"key":"B","text":"thorough"},{"key":"C","text":"thoroughness"},{"key":"D","text":"though"}]'::jsonb, 'A', 'El adverbio "thoroughly" modifica al verbo "review" (revisar minuciosamente).', 'Adverbios de modo', 'easy', NULL),
  ('q6-11', 'p6-03', 6, 11, 'Select the best option for blank [3]:', '[{"key":"A","text":"Early feedback indicates that these changes will significantly increase our operational output."},{"key":"B","text":"The weather forecast predicts heavy rainfall this weekend."},{"key":"C","text":"All flights from the terminal have been canceled."},{"key":"D","text":"The parking lot will be closed for repaving tomorrow."}]'::jsonb, 'A', 'La opción A mantiene la coherencia temática del texto formal sobre mejoras operativas.', 'Inserción de oraciones lógicas', 'hard', NULL),
  ('q6-12', 'p6-03', 6, 12, 'Select the best option for blank [4]:', '[{"key":"A","text":"promptly"},{"key":"B","text":"prompt"},{"key":"C","text":"promptness"},{"key":"D","text":"prompter"}]'::jsonb, 'A', '"Promptly" es el adverbio que modifica la acción "reach out" (contactar con prontitud).', 'Adverbios y modificadores verbales', 'medium', NULL),
  ('q6-13', 'p6-04', 6, 13, 'Select the best option for blank [1]:', '[{"key":"A","text":"comprehensive"},{"key":"B","text":"comprehensively"},{"key":"C","text":"comprehend"},{"key":"D","text":"comprehension"}]'::jsonb, 'A', 'El adjetivo "comprehensive" (exhaustivo, integral) califica adecuadamente al sustantivo plural "guidelines".', 'Formas de palabras (Adjetivos)', 'medium', NULL),
